@startuml
!include style.iuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Context map (arrows go from upstream to downstream)

rectangle "auth-service" {
  component "Identity and Access" as IAM
}
rectangle "customer-service" {
  component "Customers" as CUS
}
rectangle "fleet-service" {
  component "Fleet" as FLE
}
cloud "Payment provider\n(simulated)" as PROV
rectangle "booking-service" {
  component "Pricing" as PRI #FFF2CC
  component "Reservations" as RES #FFF2CC
  component "Payments" as PAY
}
rectangle "rental-service" {
  component "Rental" as REN
}
rectangle "notification-service" {
  component "Notifications" as NOTI
}

CUS --> RES : C/S, OHS\nREST
FLE --> PRI : PL\nevents
FLE --> RES : PL + ACL\nevents
PRI --> RES : C/S, OHS + PL\nin-process
PROV --> PAY : ACL
PAY --> RES : OHS\ninternal events
PAY --> REN : OHS\nREST + messages
RES <--> REN : C/S: reservation events →\n← PL: RentalStarted, VehicleReturned
FLE <--> REN : OHS: vehicle assignment (REST) →\n← PL: VehicleReturned (Fleet conformist)

note right of NOTI
  Conformist: consumes the events of
  Customers, Reservations, Payments and Rental
end note
note right of IAM
  OHS: every service validates the JWT with
  the JWKS of the auth-service (conformist)
end note

legend bottom
  C/S Customer/Supplier · OHS Open Host Service · PL Published Language · ACL Anti-Corruption Layer
  core subdomains in yellow; the integration of each relation is in the report's table
endlegend
@enduml
